msgid "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Mitigation is a package for handling noise in quantum computations. It contains a set of techniques that can be used to build advanced or customized error mitigation pipelines directly with [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Specifically, it contains:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation ialah pakej untuk mengendalikan hingar dalam pengiraan kuantum. Ia mengandungi satu set teknik yang boleh digunakan untuk membina saluran paip mitigasi ralat yang lanjutan atau tersuai terus dengan [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Secara khusus, ia mengandungi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementations of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), and Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) with Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) and gate folding amplification methods.\n"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), dan Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) dengan kaedah amplifikasi Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) dan gate folding.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Functionality for computing a postselected noise channel, from circuit symmetries or spacetime checks, to be used with PEC to reduce sampling overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Fungsi untuk mengira saluran hingar terpascapilih, daripada simetri litar atau semakan ruang-masa, untuk digunakan bersama PEC bagi mengurangkan overhed pensampelan [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Postselection using non-Markovian error checks to filter corrupted samples out of measured data.\n"
msgstr "Pascapemilihan menggunakan semakan ralat bukan Markov untuk menapis sampel yang rosak keluar daripada data yang diukur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for expectation value calculation with advanced error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk pengiraan nilai jangkaan dengan mitigasi ralat lanjutan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
